    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "Well, in one sense, yes, because there are people who have predatory designs on us. You know, Trump and his coterie, his entourage in this movement are determined to rule or ruin. Either they're going to control the government and the state apparatus for their own private money making purposes and ideological purposes, or they're going to ruin our opportunity to get anything done. So that puts us a serious danger zone. On the other hand, I do tell people the vast majority of Americans are on an hour side. Hillary beat him by more than three million votes. Joe Biden beat him by seven and a half million votes. The young people are coming on the side of democracy. The new Americans are coming on the side of democracy. And so they've got a bag of tricks over there with the voter suppression, the electoral college, the gerrymandering congressional districts, the packing of the courts, right-wing judicial activism, but they need them because anything approximating real democracy would put them out of business.",
