    "turn_text": "seditious conspiracies that were arrayed against us. We are eager to, but our goal as a select committee is to get the truth to the people so we can make reasonable and urgent decisions about what we need to do to protect ourselves going forward. And some of that has to do with shatterproof glass at different levels of the capital. Some of it has to do with reform of the Electoral Count Act and the Insurrection Act. And to my mind, We need to secure the right to vote and we need to secure the counting of votes against partisan manipulation and distortion, which is really what we're up against in a lot of parts of the country right now.",
