    "turn_text": "Well, yes, indeed. I mean, those police officers saved our lives and not just the lives of the partisans of democracy, but the lives of putatively, at least the lives of people who were on the side of the insurrection in the coup. Now, it may have been that they wouldn't have been killed had it come to that. I don't know the answer to it, but certainly there was a lot of fear and terror on their side of the aisle, as well as on our side of the aisle.",
